      MaskDescription "Space-vector PWM with the minimum-phase-error (MPE) or the minimum-magnitude-error (MME) overmodulation (PWM), with the duty-ratio error model d_err = dead_time_error(i_abc, d_abc, t_d, T_s, sign) and its compensation, and the minimum pulses. The blocks inside are its methods compute_output and get_realized_voltage."
      MaskInit      "% MME overmodulation, or MPE\nmme = strcmp(overmodulation, 'MME');\n"
